[TribesMPHelpMenu_DoneButton]
Caption=DONE

[TribesMPHelpMenu_DontShowLabel]
Caption=DON'T SHOW THIS MESSAGE AGAIN

[TribesMPHelpMenu_TitleLabel]
Caption=MULTIPLAYER HELP

[TribesMPHelpMenu_TipOneLabel]
Caption=Changing your equipment in Tribes is critical.  You can change your armor type, get a very powerful pack, and pick new weapons at Inventory Stations.  Look for Inventory Stations in your team's base.

[TribesMPHelpMenu_TipTwoLabel]
Caption=Tribes is about the freedom of movement.  Press 'RIGHTMOUSE' to use your jetpack and fly into the air.  Your jetpack has a limited amount of energy, but it recharges quickly.  Press 'SPACEBAR' to ski down slopes.  This ability is unlimited but requires practice.

[TribesMPHelpMenu_TipThreeLabel]
Caption=Tribes is about choosing a role that matches your playing style.  If you don't have fun using a particular equipment combination, try using different equipment.  If you don't have fun going offense, try staying on defense and protecting your base.  If you don't have fun fighting, try using a vehicle or turret, or try deploying equipment that you can find in your team's base.

[TribesMPHelpMenu_TipFourLabel]
Caption=Tribes is about teamwork.  Coordinate with your team to maximize your effectiveness.  Press 'T' to chat to your team.  Press and hold 'SHIFT' to access a menu of pre-recorded chats.  Press 'C' to see a strategic command map.

[TribesMPHelpMenu_TipFiveLabel]
Caption=To browse game hints, press 'ESCAPE' while playing, then click the Hints tab.  To see this message again, press the Help button on the Hints tab.

